Pārdot - is a convenient classifieds service where you can easily sell or buy any goods, real estate or vehicles.
The application interface is simple and intuitive, it allows you to easily and quickly publish ads and find current offers. Communication with a potential client or seller is carried out through an internal chat, which allows you to hide personal data, such as email or phone.

Pārdot application is:
- free ad service;
- favourable prices for submitting ads;
- convenient interface;
- advanced search filter that allows you to save time searching for what you need;
- impersonal contact with a customer or seller via internal chat;
- convenient management of ads through your personal account, having only a phone;
- convenient balance top-up.
Instant sales from your phone, it's convenient, fast and easy. Leave an ad and in a few minutes it will be seen by thousands of potential buyers.

Join and leave your feedback, suggestions, comments.
We are always happy to receive feedback, if necessary, technical support in the application will answer all your questions.

